{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07873","headline":"长安早春 · 孟浩然","name":"长安早春","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"关戍惟东井，城池起北辰。\n咸歌太平日，共乐建寅春。\n雪尽青山树，冰开黑水滨。\n草迎金埒马，花伴玉楼人。\n鸿渐看无数，莺歌听欲频。\n何当遂荣擢，归及柳条新。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟浩然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07873.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07873","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}